  "description": "From [Gourmet Scans](https://www.mangaupdates.com/groups.html?id=70765517392):  \nThe exact moment I blew out the candles on my seventh birthday cake.\n\nI realized that I had been reincarnated into a novel.\n\nAnd not just anywhere. As the daughter of the protagonists!\n\nThe problem was...\n\n[The heroine dies, and the male leads bring about something like the end of the world?]\n\nMom dies in the side story, and my dads cause the apocalypse?\n\nIs that seriously for real...?\n\n'No way. I'll stop it no matter what!'\n\nI'm a brave seven-year-old now!\n\nSo I did everything I could to lead my dads and somehow twist the original story off its intended path.\n\n\"You know that? You and I are destined to fall in love with each other someday.\"\n\nI'm already busy trying to save my mom, so who are you supposed to be?\n\n***\n\nAfter successfully changing the original story.\n\nI was finally about to enjoy my youth.\n\n\"A prospective son-in-law? Sure. I've only got one condition. I don't care who it is as long as they meet it.\"\n\n\"What's the condition?\"\n\n\"Beat us in a fight.\"\n\n\"No matter the reason, anyone who lays a hand on my daughter is as good as dead.\"\n\nApparently, my dads have no intention of living peacefully.\n\n\"That's easy. I just have to win, right? Then come at me all at once.\"\n\nAnd why are you actually accepting that?!",
